    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This executioner once served the great Pirate Zaken, even putting to death Zaken's rebellious crew members. Ironically, he later decapitated Zaken himself during the riot. Following his resurrection as an undead because of Zaken's curse, he swore to never again disobey his captain's commands. He now guards Zaken's treasure in the Pirate Tunnel. Giants Lv. 11 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Giants. P. Atk. +7% Max HP +7% Attack Range +15 Resistance to Shock +20% Resistance to Dagger +10% Resistance to Dual Dagger +10% Accuracy -5 Resistance to Spear -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
